+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/populator/catalog/PersistableProductReviewPopulator.java` | modified | Preserves review id for updates. |
+| `sm-core/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/business/repositories/catalog/product/review/ProductReviewRepository.java` | modified | Uses distinct, product-scoped review queries for duplicate detection and aggregate calculation. |
+| `sm-core/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/business/services/catalog/product/review/ProductReviewServiceImpl.java` | modified | Recomputes count and one-decimal HALF_UP average after create/update/delete; returns null for missing review ids. |
+| `sm-shop/src/test/java/com/salesmanager/test/shop/integration/product/ProductReviewModelTest.java` | added | Locks down public review serialization privacy. |
+
+## Tests Added or Updated
+
+- `ProductReviewModelTest.publicReviewDoesNotSerializeCustomerPrivateData` — verifies first name is retained while email, billing, delivery, productId, and language are absent.
+
+## Local Verification
+
